<title>ISRAEL: AMERICAN ISRAELI PAPER Q2 NET DOWN.</title>
<headline>AMERICAN ISRAELI PAPER Q2 NET DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Israeli Paper Mills Ltd reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels except EPS)</p>
<p>			   Q2 97    Q2 96	6-MTH 97    6-MTH 96</p>
<p>Revenue		  288,081  271,062    603,105     593,728</p>
<p>Operating Profit	14,611    7,751     35,336	26,272</p>
<p>Net Profit		 7,519   55,228     20,916	69,979</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share	1.85    14.51	 5.31	 18.39</p>
<p>Note: The 1996 figures included a one-time gain of 45.5 million shekels from the sale of a subsidiary.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.53 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
